items.background:
Lenovo started its certified refurbished program in March 2024. Trellis gives estimated market shares of 27% for new and 18% for refurbished notebooks and PCs, without a source. The footprint counts:
- shipping to the refurbishing site;
- inspection, parts replacement, data wiping and quality checks;
- the footprint of spare parts;
- typical use, based on the regional grid where the device runs.
James Pennington, director of global sustainability services, says corporate IT buyers increasingly request emissions data when bidding on large deals.
